{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706730/extras/About-Section-Banners_02.png?t=1746510498\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><i><u>NOTE: This is the Demo of the full game, it only contains the first few levels.</u></i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A side-scrolling action platformer with distinct 8-bit aesthetic and chiptune music featuring a fabled warrior who battles through labyrinthine underground facilities in a dystopian sci-fi world, wielding advanced weaponry against rebellious forces while utilizing a double-edged berserk ability that increases attack power at the cost of self-damage, all in service of uncovering a reality-threatening conspiracy. Inspired by classic games like 80s to 90s NES action platformers like Ninja Gaiden, Shatterhand, Castlevania, and Shadow of the Ninja.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features included <u><i><strong>in this Demo</strong></i></u>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8-bit graphics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Side-scrolling Action Platformer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sharp controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1 full level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Sub Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 types of enemies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3706730?t=1746510498","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706730/99d365d59713b4ed671d7e09e58e2ccad8042789/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746510498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706730/a1ad3867b7e48134d5579399534fb2e3d6690523/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746510498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706730/a1ad3867b7e48134d5579399534fb2e3d6690523/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746510498","